    "High (20 Mbit/s)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hoch (20 Mbit/s)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding the iPhone in landscape fills wide car displays best. Cutting off borders removes black bars that games leave themselves (e.g. for the Dynamic Island). In the car: tap = controls (picture format, clip, info), press and hold = save clip, two fingers = zoom (if the car display supports it), drag = move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone quer halten füllt breite Autodisplays am besten. Ränder abschneiden entfernt schwarze Streifen, die Spiele selbst lassen (z. B. wegen der Dynamic Island). Im Auto: tippen = Leiste (Bildformat, Clip, Info), lange drücken = Clip speichern, zwei Finger = zoomen (wenn das Autodisplay das unterstützt), ziehen = Ausschnitt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
